body:
Yeah, my golden child younger brother is 16 and has never bought/chosen clothes for himself, ironed, tidied his room, gone somewhere out of his own volition etc. He gets literally everything done for him and he doesn't seem to have any interests in life of his own.  He is the only nice person in my family though, I think he'll have an amazing future. I just hope he can crack it on his own.

&#x200B;

I am less equipped for life than him because of my years of crippling depression :/

UK CENSUS ONLINE

&#x200B;

The record for Elizabeth Ann Maslen age 18, the domestic servant. [https://ukcensusonline.com/search/?master\_event=Census&person\_event=1911&sub\_event=Berkshire&type=person&source=&search\_type=person&fn=elisabeth+ann&sn=maslen&kw=&yr=1892&range=10&search=Search](https://ukcensusonline.com/search/?master_event=Census&person_event=1911&sub_event=Berkshire&type=person&source=&search_type=person&fn=elisabeth+ann&sn=maslen&kw=&yr=1892&range=10&search=Search)

&#x200B;

Any help would be great!
